##
## Beschreibung zu Folge 050: 
##

- Titel: MC Datapack Tutorial [26.1.2+]#050 - Rechtsklickerkennung an einem Stick

- Video: https://youtu.be/jTXxjhlmtdE

## Ziele der Folge:

- Eine Chatausgabe, wenn man ein Stick in der Hand hält und einen Rechtsklick macht
- Itemmodel vom Stick ändern

##
## ============================================================================================================================================
##

## Links:

Minecraft Wiki:
- https://de.minecraft.wiki/


## Neue Datapack Struktur:

# Datapack Strucktur:
# (+) = Neu
# (>) = Bearbeiten
# (-) = Entfernen
# (*) = Alt/Vorhanden
* Main
    * data
        * minecraft
            * tags
                * function
                    > tick.json
        + character
            + function
                + dialogs
                    + character_overview.mcfunction
                + ticks
                    + ticks_character_switch.mcfunction
                + misc
                    + detect_item.mcfunction
                    + give_character_item.mcfunction



### Files: (Kommenrtare entfernt)
## tick.json
{
    "replace": false,
    "values": [
        "respawn:tick/switch",
        "base:remove_villager_trading",
        "teleport:entities/entity_control",
        "weather:control_switch_weather",
        "quests_dorf1:trigger/trigger_action",
        "combat:tick/tick_switch_combat",
        "character:ticks/tick_character_switch"
    ]
}

## character_overview.mcfunction 
tellraw @s "Charakter Ansicht"

## ticks_character_switch.mcfunction 
function character:misc/detect_item

## detect_item.mcfunction 
execute as @a[nbt={SelectedItem:{id:"minecraft:stick",components:{"minecraft:custom_data":{tag:"character_view"}}}}] at @s unless entity @e[tag=character_view_interaction] positioned ~ ~1.3 ~ run summon minecraft:interaction ~ ~ ~ {Tags:["character_view_interaction"],width:0.5f,height:0.5f}
execute as @a[nbt={SelectedItem:{id:"minecraft:stick",components:{"minecraft:custom_data":{tag:"character_view"}}}}] at @s if entity @e[tag=character_view_interaction] positioned ~ ~1.3 ~ run teleport @e[tag=character_view_interaction] ~ ~ ~
execute as @a[nbt=!{SelectedItem:{id:"minecraft:stick",components:{"minecraft:custom_data":{tag:"character_view"}}}}] at @s run kill @e[tag=character_view_interaction]

execute as @e[tag=character_view_interaction] on target run function character:dialogs/character_overview
execute as @e[tag=character_view_interaction] run data remove entity @s interaction
execute as @e[tag=character_view_interaction] run data remove entity @s attack

## give_character_item.mcfunction 
give @s minecraft:stick[item_model="minecraft:totem_of_undying", custom_name="Charakter-Ansicht", custom_data={tag:"character_view"}]

